{
  "item": "PhantomKnight01",
  "mu_name": "Phantom Knight",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_PHANTOM_KNIGHT (72), drawn as MONSTER_MODEL_PHANTOM_KNIGHT = 53 (_enum.h:4203), so Monster54.bmd. OpenMU Version095d Maps/Icarus.cs:225 names breed 72 'Phantom Knight'. docs/icarus-port.md.",
  "world": "icarus",
  "object_type": 72,
  "monster": {
    "model_index": 53,
    "scale": 1.45
  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13613-13619, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_PHANTOM_KNIGHT: Scale = 1.45f; Weapon[0] = MODEL_DARK_BREAKER at Level 5. No BlendMesh. Its boss blow (AT_SKILL_BOSS, WebZen's Flame of Evil, sim kBosses) throws 36 BITMAP_JOINT_SPIRIT sub 1 at Scale 60 from a metre over it at CheckAttackTime(14) (:1710-1732), ours one Evil Spirit release of eight (fx/spirits). Dark Breaker's two held streaks are fx/held_lights'.",
  "right_hand": "Sword18",
  "right_hand_bone": "knife_gdf",
  "plus": {
    "right_hand": 5
  },
  "right_hand_from": "MODEL_DARK_BREAKER is Item/Sword18.bmd, built for it, at +5. Its bone is CreateCharacter's weapon switch: `case MODEL_PHANTOM_KNIGHT: c->Weapon[0].LinkBone = 30; c->Weapon[1].LinkBone = 39` (ZzzCharacter.cpp:11966-11969) -- knife_gdf in Monster54.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "Exported with --actions=all, 7 actions, 45 bones; keys 6, 6, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7. Its death plays at 0.22 (ZzzOpenData.cpp:3768-3774), in actions.json's action_overrides.",
  "sheets": {
    "lpo01": "phantom_lpo01.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Monster/lpo01.OZT (256 square, black armour, its alpha cutting 15% in rune-shaped slots), under a phantom_ prefix, with its runes filled. RenderObject's MODEL_PHANTOM_KNIGHT arm draws the body first as RENDER_CHROME in bab2.jpg (BITMAP_CHROME + 1) at BodyLight (0.9, 0.8, 1), then textured over it (ZzzObject.cpp:1361-1369), so the chrome's sliding streaks shine through the cut runes. Ours: that baked into the sheet as a pale violet, (0.9, 0.8, 1) at 0.35 -- about the chrome sheet's own mean, 70 of 255 -- blended by MU's alpha (at 0.75 the runes were loud stripes), and the sheet opaque; the streaks' slide is left out.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "lpo01": "painted_steel"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "Black painted plate, painted_steel.",
